#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:2
msgid "py.test 2.0.0: asserts++, unittest++, reporting++, config++, docs++"
msgstr "py.test 2.0.0：a斷言++、單元測試++、報告++、設定++、文件++"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:4
msgid ""
"Welcome to pytest-2.0.0, a major new release of \"py.test\", the rapid easy "
"Python testing tool.  There are many new features and enhancements, see "
"below for summary and detailed lists.  A lot of long-deprecated code has "
"been removed, resulting in a much smaller and cleaner implementation.  See "
"the new docs with examples here:"
msgstr ""
"歡迎使用 pytest-2.0.0，這是快速且方便的 Python 測試工具「py.test」的重大新版"
"本。新版本包含許多新功能和改進，請參閱以下摘要和詳細清單。大量長期棄用的程式"
"碼已被移除，使得新版本更加精簡簡潔。請在此處查看包含範例的新文件："

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:10
msgid "http://pytest.org/en/latest/index.html"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:12
msgid ""
"A note on packaging: pytest used to part of the \"py\" distribution up until "
"version py-1.3.4 but this has changed now:  pytest-2.0.0 only contains "
"py.test related code and is expected to be backward-compatible to existing "
"test code. If you want to install pytest, just type one of::"
msgstr ""
"關於打包的說明：pytest 曾經是 py 發行版的一部分，直到 py-1.3.4 版本才被包含在"
"內，但現在情況已經改變：pytest-2.0.0 只包含與 py.test 相關的程式碼，並且預計"
"會向後相容現有的測試程式碼。如果您想安裝 pytest，只需輸入以下命令之一::"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:17
msgid ""
"pip install -U pytest\n"
"easy_install -U pytest"
msgstr ""
"pip install -U pytest\n"
"easy_install -U pytest"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"Many thanks to all issue reporters and people asking questions or "
"complaining.  Particular thanks to Floris Bruynooghe and Ronny Pfannschmidt "
"for their great coding contributions and many others for feedback and help."
msgstr ""
"非常感謝所有報告問題、提出疑問或投訴的人。特別感謝 Floris Bruynooghe 和 "
"Ronny Pfannschmidt 出色的代碼貢獻，以及其他許多人的回饋和幫助。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:24
msgid "best, holger krekel"
msgstr "此致，霍爾格·克雷克爾"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:29
msgid "New Features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:31
msgid "new invocations through Python interpreter and from Python::"
msgstr "透過 Python 解釋器和從 Python 發起的新呼叫::"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:33
msgid "python -m pytest      # on all pythons >= 2.5"
msgstr "python -m pytest # 適用於所有 Python 版本 >= 2.5"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:35
msgid "or from a python program::"
msgstr "或從 Python 程式::"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:37
msgid "import pytest ; pytest.main(arglist, pluginlist)"
msgstr "導入 pytest ； pytest.main（參數列表，外掛程式列表）"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:39
msgid "see http://pytest.org/en/latest/usage.html for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"new and better reporting information in assert expressions if comparing "
"lists, sequences or strings."
msgstr "在比較列表、序列或字串時，斷言表達式中會提供新的、更好的報告資訊。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:44
msgid "see http://pytest.org/en/latest/assert.html#newreport"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:46
msgid ""
"new configuration through ini-files (setup.cfg or tox.ini recognized), for "
"example::"
msgstr "例如，透過 ini 檔案（可識別 setup.cfg 或 tox.ini）進行新配置，例如::"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"[pytest]\n"
"norecursedirs = .hg data*  # don't ever recurse in such dirs\n"
"addopts = -x --pyargs      # add these command line options by default"
msgstr ""
"[pytest]\n"
"\n"
"norecursedirs = .hg data* # 永遠不要在這樣的目錄中遞歸\n"
"\n"
"addopts = -x --pyargs # 預設新增這些命令列選項"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:53
msgid "see http://pytest.org/en/latest/customize.html"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:55
msgid ""
"improved standard unittest support.  In general py.test should now better be "
"able to run custom unittest.TestCases like twisted trial or Django based "
"TestCases.  Also you can now run the tests of an installed 'unittest' "
"package with py.test::"
msgstr ""
"改進了對標準單元測試的支援。一般來說，py.test 現在應該能夠更好地運行自訂的 "
"unittest.TestCases，例如 Twisted Trial 或基於 Django 的 TestCases。此外，您現"
"在可以使用 py.test:: 執行已安裝的 'unittest' 套件的測試::"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:60
msgid "py.test --pyargs unittest"
msgstr "py.test --pyargs unittest"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:62
msgid ""
"new \"-q\" option which decreases verbosity and prints a more nose/unittest-"
"style \"dot\" output."
msgstr ""
"新增“-q”選項，可減少輸出詳細信息，並列印更像 nose/unittest 風格的“點”輸出。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:65
msgid "many many more detailed improvements details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:68
msgid "Fixes"
msgstr "修復"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:70
msgid ""
"fix issue126 - introduce py.test.set_trace() to trace execution via PDB "
"during the running of tests even if capturing is ongoing."
msgstr ""
"修復問題 - 引入 py.test.set_trace()，以便在測試運行時透過 PDB 追蹤執行情況，"
"即使捕獲正在進行中。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"fix issue124 - make reporting more resilient against tests opening files on "
"filedescriptor 1 (stdout)."
msgstr "修復問題 - 使報告對測試開啟檔案描述符 1（stdout）上的檔案更具彈性。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"fix issue109 - sibling conftest.py files will not be loaded. (and Directory "
"collectors cannot be customized anymore from a Directory's conftest.py - "
"this needs to happen at least one level up)."
msgstr ""
"修復問題 - 同級 conftest.py 檔案將無法載入。 （且目錄收集器無法再從目錄的 "
"conftest.py 中進行自訂 - 這需要在至少上一層目錄中進行）。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:77
msgid "fix issue88 (finding custom test nodes from command line arg)"
msgstr "修復問題 （從命令列參數尋找自訂測試節點）"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:78
msgid "fix issue93 stdout/stderr is captured while importing conftest.py"
msgstr "修復問題：匯入 conftest.py 時捕捉 stdout/stderr"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:79
msgid ""
"fix bug: unittest collected functions now also can have \"pytestmark\" "
"applied at class/module level"
msgstr "修復錯誤：unittest 收集的函數現在也可以在類別/模組層級應用“pytestmark”"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:83
msgid "Important Notes"
msgstr "重要提示"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:85
msgid ""
"The usual way in pre-2.0 times to use py.test in python code was to import "
"\"py\" and then e.g. use \"py.test.raises\" for the helper. This remains "
"valid and is not planned to be deprecated.  However, in most examples and "
"internal code you'll find \"import pytest\" and \"pytest.raises\" used as "
"the recommended default way."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 2.0 版本之前，在 Python 程式碼中使用 `py.test` 的常用方法是先匯入 "
"`py`，然後使用例如 `py.test.raises` 來呼叫輔助方法。這種方法仍然有效，目前沒"
"有棄用的計劃。但是，在大多數範例和內部程式碼中，你會發現建議的預設方法是直接"
"匯入 `pytest` 並呼叫 `pytest.raises`。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"pytest now first performs collection of the complete test suite before "
"running any test. This changes for example the semantics of when "
"pytest_collectstart/pytest_collectreport are called.  Some plugins may need "
"upgrading."
msgstr ""
"pytest 現在會在執行任何測試之前先收集完整的測試套件。這改變了例如 "
"pytest_collectstart/pytest_collectreport 的呼叫語意。某些插件可能需要升級。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:96
msgid ""
"The pytest package consists of a 400 LOC core.py and about 20 builtin "
"plugins, summing up to roughly 5000 LOCs, including docstrings. To be fair, "
"it also uses generic code from the \"pylib\", and the new \"py\" package to "
"help with filesystem and introspection/code manipulation."
msgstr ""
"這個pytest 套件包含一個 400 行程式碼的 core.py 檔案和大約 20 個內建插件，總計"
"約 5000 行程式碼包括文件字串。公平地說，它還使用了來自“pylib”的通用程式碼以及"
"新的“py”包，以輔助檔案系統和程式碼自省/操作。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:102
msgid "(Incompatible) Removals"
msgstr "（不相容的）移除"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:104
msgid "py.test.config is now only available if you are in a test run."
msgstr "現在只有在測試執行階段才能使用 py.test.config。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:106
msgid "the following (mostly already deprecated) functionality was removed:"
msgstr "以下功能（大部分已棄用）已移除："

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:108
msgid ""
"removed support for Module/Class/... collection node definitions in "
"conftest.py files.  They will cause nothing special."
msgstr ""
"已移除 conftest.py 檔案中 Module/Class/... 集合節點定義的支援。這不會造成任何"
"特殊影響。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"removed support for calling the pre-1.0 collection API of \"run()\" and "
"\"join\""
msgstr "移除了對呼叫 1.0 版本之前的集合 API 中的「run()」和「join」函數的支援"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:111
msgid ""
"removed reading option values from conftest.py files or env variables. This "
"can now be done much much better and easier through the ini-file mechanism "
"and the \"addopts\" entry in particular."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:114
msgid ""
"removed the \"disabled\" attribute in test classes.  Use the skipping and "
"pytestmark mechanism to skip or xfail a test class."
msgstr ""
"已移除測試類別中的“abled”屬性。請使用 skipping 和 pytestmark 機制跳過或使測試"
"類別失敗。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"py.test.collect.Directory does not exist anymore and it is not possible to "
"provide an own \"Directory\" object. If you have used this and don't know "
"what to do, get in contact.  We'll figure something out."
msgstr ""
"py.test.collect.Directory 已不再存在，也無法提供自訂的「Directory」物件。如果"
"您之前使用過此功能但現在不知​​道該如何處理，請與我們聯絡。我們會想辦法解決。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:122
msgid ""
"Note that pytest_collect_directory() is still called but any return value "
"will be ignored.  This allows to keep old code working that performed for "
"example \"py.test.skip()\" in collect() to prevent recursion into directory "
"trees if a certain dependency or command line option is missing."
msgstr ""
"請注意，`pytest_collect_directory()` 函數仍然會被調用，但任何返回值都會被忽"
"略。這樣可以保持舊程式碼的正常運行，例如，如果缺少某些依賴項或命令列選項，舊"
"程式碼會在 `collect()` 函數中使用 `py.test.skip()` 來防止遞歸遍歷目錄樹。"

#: ../../../doc/en/announce/release-2.0.0.rst:129
msgid "see :ref:`changelog` for more detailed changes."
msgstr "請參閱 :ref:`changelog` 以了解更多詳情。"
